He didn't pay any federal income tax. So if he paid zero, that means zero. As you tell me about these very rich people, drawn from different walks of life who have this thing in common, the fact they're very wealthy, talk a little bit about their attitude toward taxes, and their attitude and obligations in some ways to footing the common bill.
他没有支付任何联邦所得税。所以如果他付了零，那就意味着零。正如你向我讲述的这些来自各行各业、有着“非常富有”这一共同点的超级富豪一样，请谈谈他们对税收的态度，以及他们在某种程度上对分摊公共开支的态度和义务。

