Some of them actually do sound a lot like Donald Trump. When I heard Donald Trump say that not paying taxes made him smart and that if he had paid his taxes, they would have been wasted anyways. I was like, yep, he's the voice of a lot of very wealthy people around the world and their wealth managers who said essentially the same thing to me. They are very committed to neoliberal ideology and very committed to the idea that these elite clients are doing the world a favor as, as wealth creators.
他们中的一些人听起来确实很像唐纳德·特朗普。当我听到唐纳德·特朗普说不交税让他显得很聪明，而且如果他交了税无论如何也都会被浪费掉时，我就想：没错，他是世界各地许多超级富豪及其财富管理师的代言人，他们对我也说过本质上完全相同的话。他们非常坚定地奉行新自由主义意识形态，并坚信这些精英客户作为财富创造者是在为世界做贡献。

