And that their initiative should be protected against the, the governments and, and what they regard as theft by taxation, by incompetent governments that would just waste any money they collected anyways. They also, by the way, regard redistribution of collected tax as immoral, because it creates dependency on the part of the poor. So I'm fascinated because what you're saying is that,
